<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW213822209 BCX0" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr;"><p class="Paragraph SCXW213822209 BCX0" paraid="1656599464" paraeid="{f744cfb6-72e9-42e9-855d-fb59fad2723d}{171}" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none;"><font style="" size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW213822209 BCX0" paraid="1656599464" paraeid="{f744cfb6-72e9-42e9-855d-fb59fad2723d}{171}" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">Hello {!Contact.FirstName} {!Contact.LastName},&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW213822209 BCX0" paraid="1656599464" paraeid="{f744cfb6-72e9-42e9-855d-fb59fad2723d}{171}" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW213822209 BCX0" paraid="1656599464" paraeid="{f744cfb6-72e9-42e9-855d-fb59fad2723d}{171}" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">Insperity is currently preparing for 4th Quarter and Year End payroll tax filings on your behalf. We currently do not have {!Case.Account}&nbsp;account number for the following tax agency:&nbsp;</font></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW213822209 BCX0" paraid="1656599464" paraeid="{f744cfb6-72e9-42e9-855d-fb59fad2723d}{171}" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW213822209 BCX0" paraid="1656599464" paraeid="{f744cfb6-72e9-42e9-855d-fb59fad2723d}{171}" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">If you have not yet registered your company, please follow the link below.&nbsp;</font></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW213822209 BCX0" paraid="1656599464" paraeid="{f744cfb6-72e9-42e9-855d-fb59fad2723d}{171}" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW213822209 BCX0" paraid="1656599464" paraeid="{f744cfb6-72e9-42e9-855d-fb59fad2723d}{171}" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none;"><font style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);" size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">Add Link&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW213822209 BCX0" paraid="1656599464" paraeid="{f744cfb6-72e9-42e9-855d-fb59fad2723d}{171}" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW213822209 BCX0" paraid="1656599464" paraeid="{f744cfb6-72e9-42e9-855d-fb59fad2723d}{171}" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">It is imperative that we have the tax agency account number to ensure that your tax return and tax payment are posted to your tax account. The account number is mandatory if the tax agency requires the return to be filed electronically. {!Case.Account}&nbsp;will be liable for any penalty and interest that results from non-compliance with this agency’s tax laws.&nbsp;</font></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW213822209 BCX0" paraid="1656599464" paraeid="{f744cfb6-72e9-42e9-855d-fb59fad2723d}{171}" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW213822209 BCX0" paraid="1656599464" paraeid="{f744cfb6-72e9-42e9-855d-fb59fad2723d}{171}" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none;"><font style="" size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">If you have any questions or concerns, please contact us.&nbsp;</font></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW213822209 BCX0" paraid="1656599464" paraeid="{f744cfb6-72e9-42e9-855d-fb59fad2723d}{171}" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none;"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" class="TextRun EmptyTextRun SCXW162090757 BCX0" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 18px; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, &quot;Open Sans_EmbeddedFont&quot;, &quot;Open Sans_MSFontService&quot;, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;"></span></p></div>]]></td>
